{"type":"message","id":"a750e0e2","parentId":"1289d059","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:45:33.362Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 error with code 1101. This seems to be an internal server error on the ECHO platform side. The GET endpoints work fine, but POST fails.\n\nI should note this in my heartbeat report and let the user know. The heartbeat is running correctly - both threads are checked, no new human discussions found. But the send endpoint is currently failing with a 500 error.\n\nLet me try once more with a minimal payload.\n","thinkingSignature":"36daf4b1ffa728e531579a68714729ae9c153ae4e28c42f9948dcd32aed8e0ac"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_brfd2sjfcq18_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"09:45 UTC heartbeat\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":391,"output":190,"cacheRead":21184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21765,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780393529981,"responseId":"066dd93ab3f2a0c71561289127e2ea6a"}}
