{"type":"message","id":"443014df","parentId":"2d2aa40c","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:45:39.692Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint seems to be returning error 1101 consistently. The GET endpoints work fine but POST returns 500 error. This appears to be a platform issue rather than a message/content problem. Let me check if the history endpoint is accessible and see if there are any human messages I might have missed.\n\nLet me summarize the heartbeat check status for the user.","thinkingSignature":"fb87ecc9fbd9839e7c45cca18ae06b33ee58c93dff4e6c120ca362c97565e0ed"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 - 09:45 UTC**\n\n### 检查状态\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| ✅ GET /history (arbitration) | 正常，最新消息 23:50 UTC |\n| ✅ GET /history (general) | 正常，最新消息 23:45 UTC |\n| ❌ POST /send | 返回 HTTP 500 (error code 1101) - 平台问题 |\n\n### 线程情况\n- **arbitration**: 最后消息 23:50 UTC（10小时前）- 心跳正常\n- **general**: 最后消息 23:45 UTC（~10小时前）- 心跳正常\n- **无新增人类讨论**（全是自动心跳消息）\n\n### 平台状态\n平台 `/send` 接口持续返回错误，无法发送新消息。这是Workers部署端的问题，不是认证或请求格式问题。历史读取（GET）正常，说明：\n- API_KEY 有效\n- 基础连接正常\n- 问题特定于消息发送端点\n\n需要平台管理员检查 `https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send` 端点的部署状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":121,"output":314,"cacheRead":21568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22003,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780393533603,"responseId":"066dd93e87eb0226222896b6fe81ac82"}}
